###8.2

### Login admin JWT
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

###Obtener mecanicos autenticado
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mecanicos/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}

###Refresh token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refresh": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.refresh}}"
}

###Token Verify
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/verify/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}"
}

### Endpoint sin autenticacion
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mecanicos/